    "description": "<p>The Solar attunes his spirit to a single weapon, gaining supernatural mastery over its defensive use for the rest of the scene. He suffers no DV penalties when attacking with the attuned weapon, and the weapon's Defense rating increases by two. The Solar may reflexively invoke this Charm's power in Step 2 to perfectly parry any attack — even one with the Unblockable keyword — at the cost of ending this Charm prematurely. The Solar may not reactivate this Charm for the rest of the scene.</p><p>Solars with Melee 5 and Essence 5 may perfect parry up to (Essence ÷ 2, rounded down) attacks before this Charm ends.</p>",
